#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{app} is running on your phone. I'd close it there, open it again on the "
"assistant's screen, and bring it back to you when I'm done. Is that OK?"
msgstr ""
"{app}正在你的手机上运行。我要先把它关掉，在助理屏上重新打开，用完再帮你恢复。"
"可以吗？"

